## Quick Fixes
- Mixed units: Use CASE to normalize units before aggregating
- Cast errors: Use `TRY_CAST` only where the input requires conversion; skip header rows only when confirmed by inspection.
- Table names: Use the catalog table name in SQL, quoted if necessary.
- String quotes: Single quotes only `'text_value'`
